# scripts/opcount: `twig run -stats` runs the twig program of N rounds that
# `twig gen -seed 1 -n N` writes; the cost of one round is the slope
# between the two sizes. The control is the hand Go interpreter of the
# same design, which prints the same counters.
unit round
sizes 200 1600
input self gen -seed 1 -n {n}
args run -stats {input}
control cmd/ergo/testdata/twig/control
